{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415699","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415699","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041569901:1":{"text":"向您致敬，尊敬的陛下，能见到您真是我的无上荣幸。","source_cn":"向您致敬，尊敬的陛下，能见到您真是我的无上荣幸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02240900A729F5E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041569902:1":{"text":"你这让人恶心的笑脸也真是辜负你自己的头衔。","source_cn":"你这让人恶心的笑脸也真是辜负你自己的头衔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD602228F322CB54C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041569903:1":{"text":"毕竟那玩意已经不复存在了——跟我母亲的王权一样。","source_cn":"毕竟那玩意已经不复存在了——跟我母亲的王权一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACB9FC34DDAFDC13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041569904:1":{"text":"所以每当看到一位国王陛下，我就会忍不住过来打个招呼——当然了，您排第一个。","source_cn":"所以每当看到一位国王陛下，我就会忍不住过来打个招呼——...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8588859EBB8CBD1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041569905:1":{"text":"哎呀呀，第一次，多么美妙又遥远的词，您想必也有同感吧？要不要为此干一杯？","source_cn":"哎呀呀，第一次，多么美妙又遥远的词，您想必也有同感吧？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x201848311AFAD430","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_f